This project maintains modifications to:
- CrabUSB crab-usb0.9.1 and usb-if0.7.0 at
  e83b56b0672460b400105f3855222af58c03af87 (MIT).
- dma-api0.7.3, registry archive SHA256
  6ce802d0c429c6966bea151e8e78eb5906d5b5e2cdebd0e960097cbe3654a3db
  (Apache-2.0; published VCS4b0046b041082d16e2befc8d6035ab63796e0b14).

The maintained patches identify all source changes. They add hosted explicit
operations, reviewed mapped-memory access, synchronization, scoped DMA ownership,
command completion validation and conservative recovery/teardown. Each changed
dma-api file carries a prominent modification notice. xhci0.9.2 is unmodified;
the reviewed context-encoding workaround is within the CrabUSB patch.

Upstream copyrights/licenses are retained in the candidate's licenses directory
and dependency-license manifest. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists the resolved
normal/build graph. Reviewed text fallbacks for incomplete published archives are
recorded in assets/licenses/fallbacks.json; supplied standard license text is
explicitly distinguished from an upstream-published file.
